    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the host through a series of increasingly difficult physics based levels, with varying game mechanics. Throughout ball game, you will be required to roll, jump, aim/release, time meters, and rotate walls to get your ball to the finish line. Each level must be completed under a certain amount of time, and make sure to not upset the host.</p>",
